(3. Operations and Complexity) '
(- Tree-Search\(x, k\): Discards half the tree at each level. Cost: O\(h\).) '
(- Tree-Insert\(T, z\): Traces path from root to leaf boundary with trailing pointer. Cost: O\(h\).) '
(- Tree-Successor\(x\): Smallest key greater than x.key. Concludes at 18:42 timestamp in lecture.) '
(- Tree-Delete\(T, z\): 3 structural cases \(leaf, single child, two children with successor substitution\).) '
(- Tree Degeneracy: Inserting sorted keys [1..N] produces height h = N-1, collapsing operations to O\(N\).) '
(Balanced AVL and Red-Black trees prevent degeneracy via local O\(1\) tree rotations.) '
ET
endstream
